          "content": {
            "size": 80384,
            "mimeType": "application/javascript",
            "text": "\u0000\u0015\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tRGT7xFYE1\u0000\u0000\u0000\tcreatedAt\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0001�\u001f}K;\u0000\u0000\u0000\tupdatedAt\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0001�9��\u0012\u0000\u0000\u0000\nnextItemId\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\trDydImdoT\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTotYLFqSn\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0013northwind-editorial\u0000\u0000\u0000\tjbdBVbl3h\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0013Northwind Editorial\u0000\u0000\u0000\twVKHNSuTC\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?width=1200&height=795\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=795 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=795 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?width=1200&height=795 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":795}\u0000\u0000\u0000\tmq0eWtBEC\u0005\u0000\u0000\u0000\ty72IubAIV\u0000\u0000\u0000\tNWx5CmGIH\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000fNorthwind Press\u0000\u0000\u0000\tIKpV3idiu\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u00042025\u0000\u0000\u0000\tuHIiVM0f7\f\u0000\u0000\u0000OA quarterly print series redrawn around a single measure and a strict baseline.\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTQlyc4LYg\f\u0000\u0000\u0001\u0012Northwind publishes long essays with very little imagery, so the grid carries the whole reading experience. We reset the series on one measure and a baseline that holds across footnotes, pull quotes and plates, which let the press typeset an issue in days rather than weeks.\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMLdub4Cf1\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\bApproach\u0000\u0000\u0000\tJlDz2I3mw\u0001\u0000\u0003\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMovVmTu_T\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?width=1200&height=795\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=795 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=795 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?width=1200&height=795 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":795}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHVRsPCQvI\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMovVmTu_T\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?width=1200&height=800\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=800 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=800 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?width=1200&height=800 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":800}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tCQnPrajiO\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMovVmTu_T\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?width=1200&height=938\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=938 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=938 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?width=1200&height=938 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":938}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\th_Db7HInV\u0000\u0000\u0000\triLYNSE32\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0003�[1,[4,\"h3\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"One measure, one baseline\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"One measure. One baseline. Everything else earns its place.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Footnotes, captions and running heads were all pulled onto the same rhythm, so a spread never has to be nudged by hand.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The measure was set at 62 characters and never moved again. Everything that might once have been a judgement call — a sunk initial, a plate caption, a two-line epigraph — became a position on the baseline instead.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Long essays are mostly texture. A reader never notices a grid working, but they feel it the moment it slips, usually as fatigue twenty pages in rather than as a complaint about the design.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"We kept one deliberate exception. Plates break the measure and run full width, because an image that obeys the text block stops being evidence and starts being decoration.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tXLMO7aY2_\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\nMy Process\u0000\u0000\u0000\tC_x3Rv7F7\u0001\u0000\u0004\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\bResearch\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"We read four back issues and logged every typographic decision. Most were one-offs made under deadline, which is why no two spreads agreed with each other.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/30kURWgyQWdlK3sI7IOyiyCd6Y.jpg?width=1600&height=1446\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/30kURWgyQWdlK3sI7IOyiyCd6Y.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1446 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/30kURWgyQWdlK3sI7IOyiyCd6Y.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1446 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/30kURWgyQWdlK3sI7IOyiyCd6Y.jpg?width=1600&height=1446 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1446}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\twjjiDp7EG\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\rBrainstorming\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The question was how little we could specify and still hold a 90-page essay together. We landed on one measure and one baseline, with everything else derived from them.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/SQwEFGO1IyEYeVBw6ceLAgXoXHI.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/SQwEFGO1IyEYeVBw6ceLAgXoXHI.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/SQwEFGO1IyEYeVBw6ceLAgXoXHI.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/SQwEFGO1IyEYeVBw6ceLAgXoXHI.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tV3RF923uL\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000bTypesetting\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Footnotes, captions, pull quotes and running heads were all pulled onto the same rhythm. A spread now composes without anyone nudging it by hand.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/EbBZYa9WZEL0XjDdN8QmhyKiQ.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/EbBZYa9WZEL0XjDdN8QmhyKiQ.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/EbBZYa9WZEL0XjDdN8QmhyKiQ.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/EbBZYa9WZEL0XjDdN8QmhyKiQ.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tRPxIT5WmP\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\bProofing\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Two full issues were set on the new system before handover, with the press typesetter driving. Where they reached for a manual override, we fixed the rule instead.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/wWsO5fxpB0ys8ogNVGHCapayvY.jpg?width=1600&height=1069\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/wWsO5fxpB0ys8ogNVGHCapayvY.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1069 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/wWsO5fxpB0ys8ogNVGHCapayvY.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1069 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/wWsO5fxpB0ys8ogNVGHCapayvY.jpg?width=1600&height=1069 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1069}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tgBV81a6fP\u0000\u0000\u0000\tEyR2Wzw92\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0006Result\u0000\u0000\u0000\tZP1WHsR_A\u0001\u0000\u0002\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/2lQktXq3CeYZOEGlkvM0p0jr4BY.jpg?width=1200&height=800\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/2lQktXq3CeYZOEGlkvM0p0jr4BY.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=800 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/2lQktXq3CeYZOEGlkvM0p0jr4BY.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=800 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/2lQktXq3CeYZOEGlkvM0p0jr4BY.jpg?width=1200&height=800 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":800}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tSHaHY1Bir\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?width=1200&height=800\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=800 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=800 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?width=1200&height=800 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":800}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tAGJxUkU1i\u0000\u0000\u0000\tsyIho584u\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0003T[1,[4,\"h3\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Four issues, set in-house\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Four issues produced on the new system, with typesetting time down by roughly two thirds.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The press now sets issues in-house without design oversight.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The first issue took eleven days and the fourth took three. Most of that came from decisions that no longer had to be made — the system had already made them, in a way an editor could defend to a contributor.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"A nine-page specification sits alongside the templates. It is written for an editor rather than a designer, which is the only reason anyone reads it.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Two contributors have since asked for the measure to use in their own typesetting. That is the clearest evidence we have that it holds.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tCZlJgboHp\u0001\u0000\u0003\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\trDydImdoT\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tDwV59oRsc\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tQUWcA5vdt\u0000\u0016\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\trDydImdoT\u0000\u0000\u0000\tcreatedAt\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0001�\u001f}L\b\u0000\u0000\u0000\tupdatedAt\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0001�9��-\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000epreviousItemId\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tRGT7xFYE1\u0000\u0000\u0000\nnextItemId\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tDwV59oRsc\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTotYLFqSn\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0018grid-system-for-meridian\u0000\u0000\u0000\tjbdBVbl3h\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0018Grid System for Meridian\u0000\u0000\u0000\twVKHNSuTC\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/QK5vQxPfpglnowvHXNzU2lonVzY.jpg?width=1200&height=900\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/QK5vQxPfpglnowvHXNzU2lonVzY.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=900 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/QK5vQxPfpglnowvHXNzU2lonVzY.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=900 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/QK5vQxPfpglnowvHXNzU2lonVzY.jpg?width=1200&height=900 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":900}\u0000\u0000\u0000\tmq0eWtBEC\u0005\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyIK_8dNXm\u0000\u0000\u0000\tNWx5CmGIH\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\rMeridian Labs\u0000\u0000\u0000\tIKpV3idiu\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u00042024\u0000\u0000\u0000\tuHIiVM0f7\f\u0000\u0000\u0000TA responsive layout system and component library for a research group's public site.\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTQlyc4LYg\f\u0000\u0000\u0001\fMeridian publishes dense technical work to a mixed audience. We built a layout system that lets a diagram, a table and a long paragraph sit on the same page without any of them feeling like an exception, then handed over components the researchers maintain themselves.\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMLdub4Cf1\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0007Problem\u0000\u0000\u0000\tJlDz2I3mw\u0001\u0000\u0003\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMovVmTu_T\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/QK5vQxPfpglnowvHXNzU2lonVzY.jpg?width=1200&height=900\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/QK5vQxPfpglnowvHXNzU2lonVzY.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=900 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/QK5vQxPfpglnowvHXNzU2lonVzY.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=900 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/QK5vQxPfpglnowvHXNzU2lonVzY.jpg?width=1200&height=900 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":900}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tIkxFlvina\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMovVmTu_T\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/2lQktXq3CeYZOEGlkvM0p0jr4BY.jpg?width=1200&height=800\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/2lQktXq3CeYZOEGlkvM0p0jr4BY.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=800 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/2lQktXq3CeYZOEGlkvM0p0jr4BY.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=800 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/2lQktXq3CeYZOEGlkvM0p0jr4BY.jpg?width=1200&height=800 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":800}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tkqD4gFNUu\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMovVmTu_T\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?width=1200&height=800\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=800 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=800 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?width=1200&height=800 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":800}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tBAutFY_mh\u0000\u0000\u0000\triLYNSE32\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0004\u0011[1,[4,\"h3\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"A vocabulary, not a redesign\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Every new paper arrived with a layout request. The site had become a pile of one-off pages.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The fix was not a redesign but a \"],[4,\"em\",null,[5,\"vocabulary\"]],[5,\": a small set of blocks that cover the real range of content.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"We audited 140 published pages and found 31 distinct layouts, of which eleven accounted for almost everything. The remaining twenty were variations nobody could justify once they were lined up side by side.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Research sites fail in a particular way. The content is unusually demanding — tables, equations, figures with multi-paragraph captions — and the people publishing it are not designers and should not have to become designers.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"So the brief inverted. Rather than ask what the site should look like, we asked what a researcher should be able to publish on a Friday afternoon without asking permission.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tXLMO7aY2_\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\nMy Process\u0000\u0000\u0000\tC_x3Rv7F7\u0001\u0000\u0004\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\bResearch\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"We catalogued every page on the existing site and sorted them by what they actually contained, not what they were called. Eleven real content shapes came out of roughly sixty pages.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/I6iJMm3fn5iHHdBMgwCZqvPC0w.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/I6iJMm3fn5iHHdBMgwCZqvPC0w.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/I6iJMm3fn5iHHdBMgwCZqvPC0w.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/I6iJMm3fn5iHHdBMgwCZqvPC0w.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tfxHnvkDYL\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\rBrainstorming\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The team expected a redesign. We argued for a vocabulary instead — a small set of blocks that cover the real range, so a new paper never needs a new layout.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/0eQjxtBfi6zEnpExDo4NCIfr6c.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/0eQjxtBfi6zEnpExDo4NCIfr6c.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/0eQjxtBfi6zEnpExDo4NCIfr6c.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/0eQjxtBfi6zEnpExDo4NCIfr6c.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tDgxvbYQab\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000bPrototyping\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Each block was built against the densest example we could find: a full-width diagram, a twelve-column table, a 4,000-word essay. If it held there, it held everywhere.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/ejjEREA4sxX5bZQzRg6AquHg.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/ejjEREA4sxX5bZQzRg6AquHg.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/ejjEREA4sxX5bZQzRg6AquHg.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/ejjEREA4sxX5bZQzRg6AquHg.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyzQOK1aWI\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\bHandover\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"We migrated the archive onto the new blocks and wrote a two-page usage note. The researchers have published without design input since.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/tCwPFqtTjusk2rrOhcrhwyRrgDw.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/tCwPFqtTjusk2rrOhcrhwyRrgDw.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/tCwPFqtTjusk2rrOhcrhwyRrgDw.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/tCwPFqtTjusk2rrOhcrhwyRrgDw.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tcWcHa1qS3\u0000\u0000\u0000\tEyR2Wzw92\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\bDelivery\u0000\u0000\u0000\tZP1WHsR_A\u0001\u0000\u0002\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?width=1200&height=938\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=938 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=938 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?width=1200&height=938 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":938}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tSpDTRpf04\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?width=1200&height=795\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=795 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=795 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?width=1200&height=795 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":795}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tLA4R_insA\u0000\u0000\u0000\tsyIho584u\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0004a[1,[4,\"h3\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Eleven components and a usage note\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Eleven components, a two-page usage note, and a migration of the existing archive.\"]],[4,\"ul\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Fluid 12-column grid\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Table and figure blocks with shared captions\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Dark mode from the same tokens\"]]]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The archive migration was the part we underestimated. All 140 pages were rebuilt against the new blocks over six weeks, and roughly a fifth of them turned up content the components could not yet hold — mostly inline equations inside table cells, which is as awkward as it sounds.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Handover was a working session rather than a document. Two researchers published a paper each while we watched, and the questions they asked became the usage note.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Eighteen months on the component count is twelve. One block was added, none were removed, and nobody has asked for a bespoke page.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tCZlJgboHp\u0001\u0000\u0003\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tDwV59oRsc\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tQUWcA5vdt\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tGBYeeO0g_\u0000\u0016\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tDwV59oRsc\u0000\u0000\u0000\tcreatedAt\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0001�\u001f}L�\u0000\u0000\u0000\tupdatedAt\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0001�9�\u001d�\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000epreviousItemId\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\trDydImdoT\u0000\u0000\u0000\nnextItemId\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tQUWcA5vdt\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTotYLFqSn\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\rspecimen-no-4\u0000\u0000\u0000\tjbdBVbl3h\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000eSpecimen No. 4\u0000\u0000\u0000\twVKHNSuTC\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jKswCb7o0yo2fTbOY8zCNAChXA0.jpg?width=1600&height=1068\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jKswCb7o0yo2fTbOY8zCNAChXA0.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1068 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jKswCb7o0yo2fTbOY8zCNAChXA0.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1068 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jKswCb7o0yo2fTbOY8zCNAChXA0.jpg?width=1600&height=1068 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1068}\u0000\u0000\u0000\tmq0eWtBEC\u0005\u0000\u0000\u0000\tnU1kzgM1F\u0000\u0000\u0000\tNWx5CmGIH\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000eSelf-initiated\u0000\u0000\u0000\tIKpV3idiu\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u00042024\u0000\u0000\u0000\tuHIiVM0f7\f\u0000\u0000\u0000RA printed specimen exploring how far a single typeface stretches before it breaks.\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTQlyc4LYg\f\u0000\u0000\u0000�A self-initiated study: take one typeface and push it from six point to two metres, documenting where it stops working. The result is part specimen, part argument about the limits of optical sizing, printed in an edition of 200.\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMLdub4Cf1\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0007Premise\u0000\u0000\u0000\tJlDz2I3mw\u0001\u0000\u0002\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMovVmTu_T\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?width=1200&height=800\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=800 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=800 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?width=1200&height=800 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":800}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tbSYRTTlD0\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMovVmTu_T\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?width=1200&height=938\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=938 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=938 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?width=1200&height=938 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":938}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tPdGHCCKsc\u0000\u0000\u0000\triLYNSE32\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0003�[1,[4,\"h3\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The same sentence, forty times\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Most specimens flatter the typeface. This one tries to break it.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Each spread holds the same sentence at a different size, printed on the same stock, so the failure is the subject rather than a side effect.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The sentence runs from six point to just under two metres. At the small end it fills with ink and the counters close; at the large end the curves stop reading as curves and resolve into the straight segments they were always drawn from.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Neither end is a fault. A typeface is cut for a range, and a specimen that shows only the range it flatters is marketing rather than information.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Self-initiated work earns its keep by being allowed to fail. Nobody was waiting for this, which is precisely why it could take a position.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tXLMO7aY2_\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\nMy Process\u0000\u0000\u0000\tC_x3Rv7F7\u0001\u0000\u0004\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\bResearch\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"We collected thirty type specimens and found almost all of them flatter the typeface. None showed where it stops working, which is the thing a designer actually needs to know.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/42ltaJxqk2TSAfXSaCNcuEoAk.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/42ltaJxqk2TSAfXSaCNcuEoAk.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/42ltaJxqk2TSAfXSaCNcuEoAk.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/42ltaJxqk2TSAfXSaCNcuEoAk.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tJ7_0CpKDV\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\rBrainstorming\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The format came quickly once we fixed the rule: same sentence, same stock, one size per spread. The failure becomes the subject rather than something to hide.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/7QZ8QRNlFOOem4GTT5l8oJNajs.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/7QZ8QRNlFOOem4GTT5l8oJNajs.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/7QZ8QRNlFOOem4GTT5l8oJNajs.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/7QZ8QRNlFOOem4GTT5l8oJNajs.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tkdaEG_Ex6\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\bProofing\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Press proofs at six point showed the counters filling in sooner than the screen suggested. We reset the small end twice to find the real floor.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/aAdOrFVa0HkOyVk0NF1Yo7ApKFo.jpg?width=1600&height=1200\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/aAdOrFVa0HkOyVk0NF1Yo7ApKFo.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1200 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/aAdOrFVa0HkOyVk0NF1Yo7ApKFo.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1200 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/aAdOrFVa0HkOyVk0NF1Yo7ApKFo.jpg?width=1600&height=1200 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1200}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tiHr0uhZ7U\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\nProduction\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"An edition of 200, offset on uncoated stock, sewn and deliberately left unbound at the spine. The two-metre setting ships folded.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/IVMamyzDPXM47KcVxdS0goCZeUA.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/IVMamyzDPXM47KcVxdS0goCZeUA.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/IVMamyzDPXM47KcVxdS0goCZeUA.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/IVMamyzDPXM47KcVxdS0goCZeUA.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tUDJBsurzQ\u0000\u0000\u0000\tEyR2Wzw92\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\nProduction\u0000\u0000\u0000\tZP1WHsR_A\u0001\u0000\u0003\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?width=1200&height=800\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=800 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=800 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?width=1200&height=800 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":800}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tWnPSI4ark\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/QK5vQxPfpglnowvHXNzU2lonVzY.jpg?width=1200&height=900\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/QK5vQxPfpglnowvHXNzU2lonVzY.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=900 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/QK5vQxPfpglnowvHXNzU2lonVzY.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=900 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/QK5vQxPfpglnowvHXNzU2lonVzY.jpg?width=1200&height=900 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":900}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tPPs1RaO4E\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/2lQktXq3CeYZOEGlkvM0p0jr4BY.jpg?width=1200&height=800\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/2lQktXq3CeYZOEGlkvM0p0jr4BY.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=800 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/2lQktXq3CeYZOEGlkvM0p0jr4BY.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=800 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/2lQktXq3CeYZOEGlkvM0p0jr4BY.jpg?width=1200&height=800 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":800}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tlGN9SzGgQ\u0000\u0000\u0000\tsyIho584u\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0003�[1,[4,\"h3\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Two hundred, sewn and unbound\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Edition of 200, offset on uncoated stock, sewn and left unbound at the spine.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The two-metre setting ships folded, which turned out to be the most-photographed part of the book.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Uncoated stock was the whole argument. Coated paper holds the small sizes and hides the thing we were trying to show, so dot gain at six point was accepted as evidence rather than treated as a printing error — a position that cost us one press check and a very patient printer.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Leaving the spine unbound was practical before it was decorative. The fold-out needs the book to lie flat, and sewing without a case was the cheapest way to get there.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The edition sold through in four months, almost entirely to type designers, which was both gratifying and completely predictable.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tCZlJgboHp\u0001\u0000\u0003\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tQUWcA5vdt\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tGBYeeO0g_\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTDKghDQMs\u0000\u0016\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tQUWcA5vdt\u0000\u0000\u0000\tcreatedAt\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0001�\u001f}M�\u0000\u0000\u0000\tupdatedAt\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0001�9�/�\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000epreviousItemId\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tDwV59oRsc\u0000\u0000\u0000\nnextItemId\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tGBYeeO0g_\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTotYLFqSn\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\fpattern-wall\u0000\u0000\u0000\tjbdBVbl3h\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\fPattern Wall\u0000\u0000\u0000\twVKHNSuTC\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?width=1200&height=800\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=800 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=800 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?width=1200&height=800 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":800}\u0000\u0000\u0000\tmq0eWtBEC\u0005\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHbx9LeL8N\u0000\u0000\u0000\tNWx5CmGIH\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\rTessel Studio\u0000\u0000\u0000\tIKpV3idiu\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u00042023\u0000\u0000\u0000\tuHIiVM0f7\f\u0000\u0000\u0000LA generative wall projection built from the studio's existing tile geometry.\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTQlyc4LYg\f\u0000\u0000\u0001\u0003Tessel wanted their showroom wall to move without turning into a screensaver. We took the tile set they already manufacture and drove it with slow noise, so the motion reads as the same product rearranging itself rather than an animation playing on top of it.\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMLdub4Cf1\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\nConstraint\u0000\u0000\u0000\tJlDz2I3mw\u0001\u0000\u0002\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMovVmTu_T\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?width=1200&height=800\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=800 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=800 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?width=1200&height=800 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":800}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\trGxsi_Jqu\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMovVmTu_T\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?width=1200&height=795\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=795 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=795 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?width=1200&height=795 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":795}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tQfa96B8NF\u0000\u0000\u0000\triLYNSE32\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0003�[1,[4,\"h3\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Motion the tiles could actually make\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The motion had to come from the real tile geometry. Nothing invented, nothing that could not be laid by hand.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"That ruled out most easing and all of the obvious transitions.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Tessel make glazed tiles in four shapes. Every state the wall passes through has to be an arrangement a tiler could lay tomorrow, which means the piece is not interpolating between pictures — it is walking between valid layouts.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Easing was the first casualty. A tile cannot sit halfway between two positions, so the motion is stepped, and the rhythm of those steps became the only expressive control left to us.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The constraint sounded like a limitation when the studio first described it. Three weeks in, it was the reason the piece looked like nothing else in the showroom.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tXLMO7aY2_\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\nMy Process\u0000\u0000\u0000\tC_x3Rv7F7\u0001\u0000\u0004\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\bResearch\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"We measured the studio's existing tile set and rebuilt its geometry exactly, including the tolerances. Anything the motion did had to be something a tiler could actually lay.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/sNr27OZ78EnUu6a4NdasdIAopg.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/sNr27OZ78EnUu6a4NdasdIAopg.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/sNr27OZ78EnUu6a4NdasdIAopg.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/sNr27OZ78EnUu6a4NdasdIAopg.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tQUK5vE3Md\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\rBrainstorming\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Most of the obvious ideas were cut by that one constraint. What survived was slow rearrangement — the same product reorganising itself rather than an animation on top of it.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/AfIbveRuF37tViDZZqwnXov253w.jpg?width=1600&height=900\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/AfIbveRuF37tViDZZqwnXov253w.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=900 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/AfIbveRuF37tViDZZqwnXov253w.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=900 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/AfIbveRuF37tViDZZqwnXov253w.jpg?width=1600&height=900 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":900}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tUy64UsH6b\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000bPrototyping\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"A single shader drives the whole wall from low-frequency noise. We spent most of the time slowing it down; anything quicker read as a screensaver.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/stz1YQmmQNqzkrZzXKgLq2WTWA.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/stz1YQmmQNqzkrZzXKgLq2WTWA.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/stz1YQmmQNqzkrZzXKgLq2WTWA.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/stz1YQmmQNqzkrZzXKgLq2WTWA.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tBsed4yRid\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0007Install\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Two projectors edge-blended across six metres, calibrated against the physical tiles on the adjacent wall. The studio reseeds the pattern from a tablet.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/CRoBlWbeVIU1jc85c4zFGU0aiTQ.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/CRoBlWbeVIU1jc85c4zFGU0aiTQ.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/CRoBlWbeVIU1jc85c4zFGU0aiTQ.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/CRoBlWbeVIU1jc85c4zFGU0aiTQ.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tvyWQKX2lc\u0000\u0000\u0000\tEyR2Wzw92\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0007Install\u0000\u0000\u0000\tZP1WHsR_A\u0001\u0000\u0003\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?width=1200&height=938\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=938 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=938 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?width=1200&height=938 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":938}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\ty6CWFCucN\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?width=1200&height=800\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=800 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=800 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?width=1200&height=800 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":800}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tjBqZ64myb\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/QK5vQxPfpglnowvHXNzU2lonVzY.jpg?width=1200&height=900\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/QK5vQxPfpglnowvHXNzU2lonVzY.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=900 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/QK5vQxPfpglnowvHXNzU2lonVzY.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=900 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/QK5vQxPfpglnowvHXNzU2lonVzY.jpg?width=1200&height=900 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":900}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTlVbYAsqP\u0000\u0000\u0000\tsyIho584u\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0003y[1,[4,\"h3\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Six metres, one shader\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Two projectors, edge-blended across six metres, running a single shader.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The studio can reseed the pattern from a tablet, which they do roughly once a week.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Everything runs from a single seed number. Change it and the wall resolves into a different arrangement over about ninety seconds, never repeating within a working day and never landing on a layout that could not be built.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The blend seam sits on a grout line. That was half a day of measuring on site and it is the only reason six metres reads as one surface rather than two projections.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Tessel now reseed it before client visits and have started photographing the states they like. Two of them have since been laid as real walls.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tCZlJgboHp\u0001\u0000\u0003\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tGBYeeO0g_\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTDKghDQMs\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tVgwkpC81r\u0000\u0016\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tGBYeeO0g_\u0000\u0000\u0000\tcreatedAt\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0001�\u001f}F�\u0000\u0000\u0000\tupdatedAt\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0001�9�?&\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000epreviousItemId\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tQUWcA5vdt\u0000\u0000\u0000\nnextItemId\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTDKghDQMs\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTotYLFqSn\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0015alder-and-co-identity\u0000\u0000\u0000\tjbdBVbl3h\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0014Alder & Co. Identity\u0000\u0000\u0000\twVKHNSuTC\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/1NY0aTNPnfpOaXfa5z8s1UvddLg.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/1NY0aTNPnfpOaXfa5z8s1UvddLg.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/1NY0aTNPnfpOaXfa5z8s1UvddLg.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/1NY0aTNPnfpOaXfa5z8s1UvddLg.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\tmq0eWtBEC\u0005\u0000\u0000\u0000\tlAFN8MoDr\u0000\u0000\u0000\tNWx5CmGIH\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000bAlder & Co.\u0000\u0000\u0000\tIKpV3idiu\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u00042025\u0000\u0000\u0000\tuHIiVM0f7\f\u0000\u0000\u0000PA wordmark and type system for a furniture maker moving from workshop to retail.\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTQlyc4LYg\f\u0000\u0000\u0001\u001eAlder & Co. had outgrown the hand-painted sign on their workshop door. We built an identity that keeps the directness of that sign while surviving a shopfront, a website and a stamped timber mark. The wordmark is drawn from a single pen angle, so it reads as made rather than specified.\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMLdub4Cf1\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tChallenge\u0000\u0000\u0000\tJlDz2I3mw\u0001\u0000\u0003\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMovVmTu_T\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/2lQktXq3CeYZOEGlkvM0p0jr4BY.jpg?width=1200&height=800\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/2lQktXq3CeYZOEGlkvM0p0jr4BY.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=800 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/2lQktXq3CeYZOEGlkvM0p0jr4BY.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=800 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/2lQktXq3CeYZOEGlkvM0p0jr4BY.jpg?width=1200&height=800 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":800}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tcm23GWCZm\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMovVmTu_T\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/QK5vQxPfpglnowvHXNzU2lonVzY.jpg?width=1200&height=900\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/QK5vQxPfpglnowvHXNzU2lonVzY.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=900 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/QK5vQxPfpglnowvHXNzU2lonVzY.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=900 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/QK5vQxPfpglnowvHXNzU2lonVzY.jpg?width=1200&height=900 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":900}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tLowNWR2Vh\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMovVmTu_T\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?width=1200&height=800\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=800 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=800 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?width=1200&height=800 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":800}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tunfoOIUKt\u0000\u0000\u0000\triLYNSE32\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0003�[1,[4,\"h3\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"One mark, every surface\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The existing mark only worked at one size, in one colour, on one surface. Everything beyond the workshop door was improvised.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"We needed a system that could be \"],[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"stamped into oak\"]],[5,\", printed on a delivery note and set as a favicon without redrawing it each time.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The workshop has been making furniture for nineteen years and had never had a second version of its logo. When something needed to be smaller, someone scaled it down and accepted whatever came back.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"End-grain oak sets the floor. A stamp die cannot hold a hairline, so the lightest any weight could ever be was decided by the timber rather than by us.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Working up from that constraint rather than down from a screen drawing is the whole project. Three weights, each drawn for a real surface, none of them an optical afterthought.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tXLMO7aY2_\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\nMy Process\u0000\u0000\u0000\tC_x3Rv7F7\u0001\u0000\u0004\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\bResearch\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0001\u001c[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Two days in the workshop, photographing the hand-painted sign, the tool wall and the stamped end-grain on finished pieces. The old mark was never designed — it was painted once and copied ever since. How it was made mattered more than how it looked.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/irAXAAHRgrRodv3VfYo0MUAnDdU.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/irAXAAHRgrRodv3VfYo0MUAnDdU.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/irAXAAHRgrRodv3VfYo0MUAnDdU.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/irAXAAHRgrRodv3VfYo0MUAnDdU.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tgGELDX3ay\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\rBrainstorming\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"We put every possible surface on one wall: a shopfront, a delivery note, a favicon, a hot stamp in oak. Anything that only worked on paper was cut on the spot.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/hIPMWwpzW350nOcP41SVYtag4.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/hIPMWwpzW350nOcP41SVYtag4.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/hIPMWwpzW350nOcP41SVYtag4.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/hIPMWwpzW350nOcP41SVYtag4.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\ttYAZIm0zZ\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0007Drawing\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The wordmark was drawn at a single pen angle so the thick and thin strokes fall where a brush would put them. Three weights followed, each tested at the size it would actually be used.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/RC7QlQHsUgkhqs3rBNpf31wP9PI.jpg?width=1600&height=1200\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/RC7QlQHsUgkhqs3rBNpf31wP9PI.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1200 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/RC7QlQHsUgkhqs3rBNpf31wP9PI.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1200 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/RC7QlQHsUgkhqs3rBNpf31wP9PI.jpg?width=1600&height=1200 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1200}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tGByo7ViTk\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0007Testing\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"We cut a trial stamp die and marked fifty offcuts to find the weight that survives being pressed into open grain. The lightest weight lost its joins, so the stamp uses the middle one.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/pdXC9ePqHd7ojmTjLUmXcdJuCY.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/pdXC9ePqHd7ojmTjLUmXcdJuCY.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/pdXC9ePqHd7ojmTjLUmXcdJuCY.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/pdXC9ePqHd7ojmTjLUmXcdJuCY.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tXJbj0o3oO\u0000\u0000\u0000\tEyR2Wzw92\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0007Outcome\u0000\u0000\u0000\tZP1WHsR_A\u0001\u0000\u0002\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?width=1200&height=795\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=795 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=795 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?width=1200&height=795 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":795}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tq0SfmifZu\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?width=1200&height=800\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=800 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=800 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?width=1200&height=800 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":800}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tzZKp8zET9\u0000\u0000\u0000\tsyIho584u\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0004@[1,[4,\"h3\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Three weights and a working specimen\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"A three-weight wordmark, a timber stamp die and a type specimen the team sets their own signage from.\"]],[4,\"ul\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Retail rollout across two stores\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Stamp die cut for end-grain marking\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Specimen handed over as a working document\"]]]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The specimen is the real deliverable. It is a printed book showing each weight at the sizes it was drawn for, with the surfaces named — oak, card, enamel, screen — so the choice is made by the job rather than by taste.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Both stores were rolled out in a fortnight, largely by the workshop team. We were on site for one day of it.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The stamp die has since turned up on things nobody specified, including invoices and the side of a delivery van. That is the point at which an identity stops being a document.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tCZlJgboHp\u0001\u0000\u0003\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTDKghDQMs\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tVgwkpC81r\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tuZLpCSml4\u0000\u0016\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTDKghDQMs\u0000\u0000\u0000\tcreatedAt\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0001�\u001f}N`\u0000\u0000\u0000\tupdatedAt\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0001�9�U�\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000epreviousItemId\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tGBYeeO0g_\u0000\u0000\u0000\nnextItemId\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tVgwkpC81r\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTotYLFqSn\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0011material-test-kit\u0000\u0000\u0000\tjbdBVbl3h\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0011Material Test Kit\u0000\u0000\u0000\twVKHNSuTC\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?width=1200&height=938\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=938 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=938 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?width=1200&height=938 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":938}\u0000\u0000\u0000\tmq0eWtBEC\u0005\u0000\u0000\u0000\tX6W9xR6zV\u0000\u0000\u0000\tNWx5CmGIH\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\fFathom Goods\u0000\u0000\u0000\tIKpV3idiu\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u00042023\u0000\u0000\u0000\tuHIiVM0f7\f\u0000\u0000\u0000?A sample kit that ships flat and opens into a standing display.\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTQlyc4LYg\f\u0000\u0000\u0001\u0006Fathom's sample kits were being thrown away on arrival. We designed a single die-cut shell that posts flat, opens into a standing display on a specifier's desk, and folds back down for return — which cut the per-kit cost and the material loss at the same time.\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMLdub4Cf1\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0005Brief\u0000\u0000\u0000\tJlDz2I3mw\u0001\u0000\u0002\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMovVmTu_T\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?width=1200&height=938\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=938 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=938 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jy2UHHFQHx6UQcnh9EY6kKdn5s.jpg?width=1200&height=938 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":938}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\twet4t5RVv\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMovVmTu_T\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/2lQktXq3CeYZOEGlkvM0p0jr4BY.jpg?width=1200&height=800\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/2lQktXq3CeYZOEGlkvM0p0jr4BY.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=800 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/2lQktXq3CeYZOEGlkvM0p0jr4BY.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=800 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/2lQktXq3CeYZOEGlkvM0p0jr4BY.jpg?width=1200&height=800 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":800}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyHB4Z_Jcc\u0000\u0000\u0000\triLYNSE32\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0003\u0001[1,[4,\"h3\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Twelve samples, one sheet of board\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Ship twelve material samples, post them flat, and have them survive being handled for a month. No foam, no adhesive, one board weight.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Fathom had been sending samples loose in padded envelopes. They arrived scuffed and in no particular order, and specifiers were judging a finish from a sample that had spent three days rubbing against eleven others.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The real constraints came from the warehouse rather than the brief. One board weight because they stock one. No adhesive because nobody has time to glue. Flat because postage is priced by thickness.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Everything after that was folding.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tXLMO7aY2_\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\nMy Process\u0000\u0000\u0000\tC_x3Rv7F7\u0001\u0000\u0004\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\bResearch\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"We asked twelve specifiers what happened to the last kit they received. Most were binned the same day, usually because there was nowhere to put them.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/0vQT9eN05Pff1z8qz4CA0s1qQ.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/0vQT9eN05Pff1z8qz4CA0s1qQ.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/0vQT9eN05Pff1z8qz4CA0s1qQ.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/0vQT9eN05Pff1z8qz4CA0s1qQ.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tDZ810CtJF\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\rBrainstorming\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"That reframed the brief from packaging to furniture: the kit had to earn desk space. Standing up turned out to be the whole idea.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/1MHzrQ3YxKimqX9o0XmwQ0Kyk.jpg?width=1600&height=1200\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/1MHzrQ3YxKimqX9o0XmwQ0Kyk.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1200 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/1MHzrQ3YxKimqX9o0XmwQ0Kyk.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1200 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/1MHzrQ3YxKimqX9o0XmwQ0Kyk.jpg?width=1600&height=1200 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1200}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tBW5nVbFef\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000bPrototyping\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Eleven die-cut mock-ups in one board weight, no foam and no glue. The winner goes flat-pack to standing display in four folds.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/s9FbbSL7TAXVynttTh623nt10Ao.jpg?width=1600&height=667\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/s9FbbSL7TAXVynttTh623nt10Ao.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=667 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/s9FbbSL7TAXVynttTh623nt10Ao.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=667 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/s9FbbSL7TAXVynttTh623nt10Ao.jpg?width=1600&height=667 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":667}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tV6jVUzrmh\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\nProduction\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"One die, one board, fully returnable. Kits now come back to be refilled rather than thrown away, which took 40% off the per-kit cost.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/BGv3LXlFbRr90iFsVSD3RX5BsA.jpg?width=1600&height=1200\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/BGv3LXlFbRr90iFsVSD3RX5BsA.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1200 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/BGv3LXlFbRr90iFsVSD3RX5BsA.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1200 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/BGv3LXlFbRr90iFsVSD3RX5BsA.jpg?width=1600&height=1200 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1200}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tXCXYUgI9g\u0000\u0000\u0000\tEyR2Wzw92\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0007Outcome\u0000\u0000\u0000\tZP1WHsR_A\u0001\u0000\u0003\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?width=1200&height=795\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=795 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=795 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/0snHUhiz7TZ4QlWcpRAHAxswjQ.jpg?width=1200&height=795 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":795}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tsPGm1VPEk\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?width=1200&height=800\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=800 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=800 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/jns6gdHWmwhjLKGvR1xCSEKFipE.jpg?width=1200&height=800 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":800}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tip0ZpiOAZ\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?width=1200&height=800\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=800 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=800 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/CHcwefjMu5GpMdYcyXUQ8zV90lg.jpg?width=1200&height=800 1200w\",\"pixelWidth\":1200,\"pixelHeight\":800}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tBbwrjsizh\u0000\u0000\u0000\tsyIho584u\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0004$[1,[4,\"h3\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"One die, no glue\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"One die, one board, no glue. Kits now come back for refilling instead of going in the bin.\"]],[4,\"ul\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Flat-pack to standing display in four folds\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Per-kit cost down 40%\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Returnable and refillable\"]]]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Four folds take it from an envelope to a standing display with the twelve samples held in their own slots. Specifiers keep it on the desk, which is a habit the old envelope never earned.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The forty per cent saving is mostly postage and breakage rather than material. A kit that arrives flat and intact does not need replacing, and about a third now come back to be refilled.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Fathom have since run the same die for two other ranges by changing only the printed sheet. We did not design for that, but a single die tends to invite it.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tCZlJgboHp\u0001\u0000\u0003\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tVgwkpC81r\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tuZLpCSml4\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tfJre5lkCo\u0000\u0016\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tVgwkpC81r\u0000\u0000\u0000\tcreatedAt\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0001�4\u001d�m\u0000\u0000\u0000\tupdatedAt\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0001�9�g}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000epreviousItemId\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTDKghDQMs\u0000\u0000\u0000\nnextItemId\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tuZLpCSml4\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTotYLFqSn\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000ehallow-brewing\u0000\u0000\u0000\tjbdBVbl3h\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000eHallow Brewing\u0000\u0000\u0000\twVKHNSuTC\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/K5grndE4XLvA3MCYTXuyXuadA.jpg?width=1600&height=2455\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/K5grndE4XLvA3MCYTXuyXuadA.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=2455 667w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/K5grndE4XLvA3MCYTXuyXuadA.jpg?scale-down-to=2048&width=1600&height=2455 1334w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/K5grndE4XLvA3MCYTXuyXuadA.jpg?width=1600&height=2455 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":2455}\u0000\u0000\u0000\tmq0eWtBEC\u0005\u0000\u0000\u0000\tX6W9xR6zV\u0000\u0000\u0000\tNWx5CmGIH\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0012Hallow Brewing Co.\u0000\u0000\u0000\tIKpV3idiu\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u00042022\u0000\u0000\u0000\tuHIiVM0f7\f\u0000\u0000\u0000SA can and carton system where one printed band carries a range of twenty-two beers.\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTQlyc4LYg\f\u0000\u0000\u00011Hallow releases a new beer most months and had been redrawing the whole label each time. We fixed everything except a single printed band — colour, name and one line of description — so a new release is a half-day job and the shelf still reads as one brewery rather than twenty-two separate decisions.\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMLdub4Cf1\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0007Problem\u0000\u0000\u0000\tJlDz2I3mw\u0001\u0000\u0003\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMovVmTu_T\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/xAOg01ENwRhl9WjQbexQO1v4Y.jpg?width=1600&height=1152\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/xAOg01ENwRhl9WjQbexQO1v4Y.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1152 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/xAOg01ENwRhl9WjQbexQO1v4Y.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1152 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/xAOg01ENwRhl9WjQbexQO1v4Y.jpg?width=1600&height=1152 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1152}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tGlZ4_6WmV\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMovVmTu_T\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/aMTx0BjBlSKe5EBUoIMqYgeZXmQ.jpg?width=2400&height=3000\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/aMTx0BjBlSKe5EBUoIMqYgeZXmQ.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=2400&height=3000 819w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/aMTx0BjBlSKe5EBUoIMqYgeZXmQ.jpg?scale-down-to=2048&width=2400&height=3000 1638w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/aMTx0BjBlSKe5EBUoIMqYgeZXmQ.jpg?width=2400&height=3000 2400w\",\"pixelWidth\":2400,\"pixelHeight\":3000}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHgooSNqu6\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMovVmTu_T\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/9ee7tZyY6XVqHq3xSyUbCh5ZUXo.jpg?width=2400&height=3600\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/9ee7tZyY6XVqHq3xSyUbCh5ZUXo.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=2400&height=3600 682w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/9ee7tZyY6XVqHq3xSyUbCh5ZUXo.jpg?scale-down-to=2048&width=2400&height=3600 1365w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/9ee7tZyY6XVqHq3xSyUbCh5ZUXo.jpg?width=2400&height=3600 2400w\",\"pixelWidth\":2400,\"pixelHeight\":3600}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tAq2HN5_yj\u0000\u0000\u0000\triLYNSE32\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0003�[1,[4,\"h3\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Twenty-two beers, no range\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Twenty-two beers, twenty-two label designs, none of them drawn by the same person.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"On a shelf the range looked like a shop rather than a brewery, and every new release restarted the argument from scratch.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The brewery had grown by adding. Each beer went to whichever illustrator was free, and over six years that produced a catalogue with no shared geometry, no shared palette and four different versions of the logo.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The cost was not only visual. Every release meant new artwork, new plates and a fortnight of lead time, so seasonal beers were being planned around the printer rather than around the brewing.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Nobody wanted twenty-two identical cans either. The range is the brewery’s personality; it just needed somewhere to live that was not the entire can.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tXLMO7aY2_\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\nMy Process\u0000\u0000\u0000\tC_x3Rv7F7\u0001\u0000\u0004\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0005Audit\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Laid all twenty-two labels out together for the first time. The brewery had never seen the range in one place.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/iP7AfQFb3xPp3aPpVEAvV8HA.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/iP7AfQFb3xPp3aPpVEAvV8HA.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/iP7AfQFb3xPp3aPpVEAvV8HA.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/iP7AfQFb3xPp3aPpVEAvV8HA.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tmTcmZi6mh\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tRange Map\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Grouped the beers by how often they are brewed, not by style. Core, seasonal, one-off — each gets a different amount of the band.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/IPaOFqF3qFO7VJZtzfa2d45sl4.jpg?width=1600&height=900\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/IPaOFqF3qFO7VJZtzfa2d45sl4.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=900 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/IPaOFqF3qFO7VJZtzfa2d45sl4.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=900 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/IPaOFqF3qFO7VJZtzfa2d45sl4.jpg?width=1600&height=900 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":900}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tNE7KY6avM\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\nPress Test\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Proofed the band on kraft and on white to check the colour held on both. Two of the greens did not and were redrawn.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/r0roJwZPeuWLRGOBJOvbwZB94.jpg?width=1600&height=1200\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/r0roJwZPeuWLRGOBJOvbwZB94.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1200 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/r0roJwZPeuWLRGOBJOvbwZB94.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1200 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/r0roJwZPeuWLRGOBJOvbwZB94.jpg?width=1600&height=1200 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1200}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\txOfHW6kWn\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0007Rollout\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Shipped the core four first, then let the seasonals catch up as stock ran down, so nothing was thrown away.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/s0b3PCEyNIwLyrSjuEp3b9goGg0.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/s0b3PCEyNIwLyrSjuEp3b9goGg0.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/s0b3PCEyNIwLyrSjuEp3b9goGg0.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/s0b3PCEyNIwLyrSjuEp3b9goGg0.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tu77goUEDu\u0000\u0000\u0000\tEyR2Wzw92\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0006System\u0000\u0000\u0000\tZP1WHsR_A\u0001\u0000\u0003\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/K5grndE4XLvA3MCYTXuyXuadA.jpg?width=1600&height=2455\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/K5grndE4XLvA3MCYTXuyXuadA.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=2455 667w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/K5grndE4XLvA3MCYTXuyXuadA.jpg?scale-down-to=2048&width=1600&height=2455 1334w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/K5grndE4XLvA3MCYTXuyXuadA.jpg?width=1600&height=2455 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":2455}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tB7vfzqCgF\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/cBQ7PjZRrd1F4q7pUorBswA6OrY.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/cBQ7PjZRrd1F4q7pUorBswA6OrY.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/cBQ7PjZRrd1F4q7pUorBswA6OrY.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/cBQ7PjZRrd1F4q7pUorBswA6OrY.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tZzy2AbNy0\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/Zxy5TH8YndFVoKJ4kxj0SVYw2M.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/Zxy5TH8YndFVoKJ4kxj0SVYw2M.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/Zxy5TH8YndFVoKJ4kxj0SVYw2M.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/Zxy5TH8YndFVoKJ4kxj0SVYw2M.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tCnCMpNSWt\u0000\u0000\u0000\tsyIho584u\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0004I[1,[4,\"h3\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"A band that changes, and nothing else\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"One carton, one can wrap, and a band that changes. Everything above and below it is locked.\"]],[4,\"ul\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Twenty-two beers on four printing plates\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"New release artwork in half a day\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Retail bags and cartons from the same band\"]]]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The band is a fixed height at a fixed position, carrying the beer name, the style and a single colour. Everything outside it — brewery mark, legal copy, volume, the grid itself — is drawn once and never revisited.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Four plates cover the whole range because the locked areas are shared. A new beer is a band, which is half a day of work and no new tooling.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The brewery now releases seasonals on the brewing schedule rather than the printer’s. Two years on they have added nine beers to the range without calling us.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tCZlJgboHp\u0001\u0000\u0003\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tuZLpCSml4\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tfJre5lkCo\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tRGT7xFYE1\u0000\u0016\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tuZLpCSml4\u0000\u0000\u0000\tcreatedAt\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0001�4\u001d��\u0000\u0000\u0000\tupdatedAt\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0001�9�y�\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000epreviousItemId\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tVgwkpC81r\u0000\u0000\u0000\nnextItemId\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tfJre5lkCo\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTotYLFqSn\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0012ostlund-wayfinding\u0000\u0000\u0000\tjbdBVbl3h\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0012Ostlund Wayfinding\u0000\u0000\u0000\twVKHNSuTC\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/2Y139OoHDGsM3NTsKnSv8yOIvpc.jpg?width=1600&height=2400\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/2Y139OoHDGsM3NTsKnSv8yOIvpc.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=2400 682w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/2Y139OoHDGsM3NTsKnSv8yOIvpc.jpg?scale-down-to=2048&width=1600&height=2400 1365w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/2Y139OoHDGsM3NTsKnSv8yOIvpc.jpg?width=1600&height=2400 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":2400}\u0000\u0000\u0000\tmq0eWtBEC\u0005\u0000\u0000\u0000\tlAFN8MoDr\u0000\u0000\u0000\tNWx5CmGIH\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000eOstlund Museum\u0000\u0000\u0000\tIKpV3idiu\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u00042023\u0000\u0000\u0000\tuHIiVM0f7\f\u0000\u0000\u0000AA sign system for a museum whose floor plan changes twice a year.\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTQlyc4LYg\f\u0000\u0000\u00017Ostlund rehangs its collection every season, which meant refabricating signage every season. We moved the museum onto a fixed panel with a replaceable insert, so a rehang now costs paper instead of metal, and set the type for a visitor standing where people actually stand rather than where the drawing assumed.\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMLdub4Cf1\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\nConstraint\u0000\u0000\u0000\tJlDz2I3mw\u0001\u0000\u0002\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMovVmTu_T\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/2Y139OoHDGsM3NTsKnSv8yOIvpc.jpg?width=1600&height=2400\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/2Y139OoHDGsM3NTsKnSv8yOIvpc.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=2400 682w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/2Y139OoHDGsM3NTsKnSv8yOIvpc.jpg?scale-down-to=2048&width=1600&height=2400 1365w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/2Y139OoHDGsM3NTsKnSv8yOIvpc.jpg?width=1600&height=2400 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":2400}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\thCxgZLxMM\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMovVmTu_T\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/apVMCnBQjmJ0iRdz9bykfUJRPg.jpg?width=1600&height=1071\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/apVMCnBQjmJ0iRdz9bykfUJRPg.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1071 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/apVMCnBQjmJ0iRdz9bykfUJRPg.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1071 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/apVMCnBQjmJ0iRdz9bykfUJRPg.jpg?width=1600&height=1071 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1071}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tOehSc8NCQ\u0000\u0000\u0000\triLYNSE32\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0003�[1,[4,\"h3\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Signs that are wrong most of the year\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The signs were correct for about six weeks a year. The rest of the time they were quietly wrong.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Refabrication was slow enough that the museum had started taping over panels, which is its own kind of answer.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Ostlund rehang four times a year. The permanent collection moves, loans arrive and leave, and a gallery that was Nordic Textiles in March is Paper and Press by June — but the signage had been fabricated as though none of that ever happened.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Each rehang meant a three-week wait and an invoice, so the museum stopped ordering and started improvising. Vinyl over aluminium, printed A4 in a frame, and eventually tape.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The brief that arrived asked for better-looking signs. The actual problem was that the signs could not be changed by the people who needed to change them.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tXLMO7aY2_\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\nMy Process\u0000\u0000\u0000\tC_x3Rv7F7\u0001\u0000\u0004\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000bFloor Study\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Followed visitors for two days to find where people actually stop. It was rarely where the signs were.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/eH4mcqczauTtaRf3RaJXd1efS4.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/eH4mcqczauTtaRf3RaJXd1efS4.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/eH4mcqczauTtaRf3RaJXd1efS4.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/eH4mcqczauTtaRf3RaJXd1efS4.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tRcpcEq_11\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\nPanel Test\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000w[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Mocked three panel heights in the gallery and left them up for a week before choosing.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/k6XDIX1CgrHsgqD1TvdLKfD3Usw.jpg?width=1600&height=1116\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/k6XDIX1CgrHsgqD1TvdLKfD3Usw.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1116 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/k6XDIX1CgrHsgqD1TvdLKfD3Usw.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1116 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/k6XDIX1CgrHsgqD1TvdLKfD3Usw.jpg?width=1600&height=1116 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1116}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\th511W0h_6\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000bType Sizing\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Set the labels at reading distance rather than on screen. Everything got about two points larger.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/9ICcpyiKJlV8YhejSWQmrnJXVaE.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/9ICcpyiKJlV8YhejSWQmrnJXVaE.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/9ICcpyiKJlV8YhejSWQmrnJXVaE.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/9ICcpyiKJlV8YhejSWQmrnJXVaE.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tijCH8qA8q\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0007Install\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000z[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Fitted the fixed panels once, then handed the insert template to the front-of-house team.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/CZQu7UqKmrpwHycHRDZT1d46nw.jpg?width=1600&height=1071\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/CZQu7UqKmrpwHycHRDZT1d46nw.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1071 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/CZQu7UqKmrpwHycHRDZT1d46nw.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1071 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/CZQu7UqKmrpwHycHRDZT1d46nw.jpg?width=1600&height=1071 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1071}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tRAKJ1YEls\u0000\u0000\u0000\tEyR2Wzw92\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0007Rollout\u0000\u0000\u0000\tZP1WHsR_A\u0001\u0000\u0003\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/PFEM56BiVnazChAeSIHV5EORac.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/PFEM56BiVnazChAeSIHV5EORac.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/PFEM56BiVnazChAeSIHV5EORac.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/PFEM56BiVnazChAeSIHV5EORac.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tUJ0YkSx3e\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/J0vouSIZns0s0JIk1oMRvInw.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/J0vouSIZns0s0JIk1oMRvInw.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/J0vouSIZns0s0JIk1oMRvInw.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/J0vouSIZns0s0JIk1oMRvInw.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tNUdn8w_pm\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/zhfMhcgHWQGC1sP8N9vRn1RyB7A.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/zhfMhcgHWQGC1sP8N9vRn1RyB7A.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/zhfMhcgHWQGC1sP8N9vRn1RyB7A.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/zhfMhcgHWQGC1sP8N9vRn1RyB7A.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tfMs3gUBKo\u0000\u0000\u0000\tsyIho584u\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0004�[1,[4,\"h3\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"One profile, changed in-house\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"A single panel profile in two heights, with a slotted insert the front-of-house team changes themselves.\"]],[4,\"ul\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Seasonal rehang down from three weeks to two days\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"One panel, two heights, no bespoke pieces\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Type sized from a standing position, not a drawing\"]]]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The insert prints on the museum’s own machine, on a stock we specified and they keep in the cupboard. Changing a gallery name is now a five-minute job for whoever is on shift.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Type was sized on site rather than on screen. We printed candidates, taped them at height and read them from where a visitor actually stands, which moved the body size up two steps from what the drawing had suggested.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Twelve panels went in over a weekend. The museum has since ordered six more in the same profile without involving us, which is the measure that matters.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tCZlJgboHp\u0001\u0000\u0003\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tfJre5lkCo\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tRGT7xFYE1\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\trDydImdoT\u0000\u0015\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tfJre5lkCo\u0000\u0000\u0000\tcreatedAt\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0001�4\u001d��\u0000\u0000\u0000\tupdatedAt\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0001�9��\u000f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000epreviousItemId\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tuZLpCSml4\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTotYLFqSn\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000equarto-reissue\u0000\u0000\u0000\tjbdBVbl3h\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000eQuarto Reissue\u0000\u0000\u0000\twVKHNSuTC\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/Y8zctiDQXuSnZzdhlRmYWtN9JQ.jpg?width=1600&height=2400\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/Y8zctiDQXuSnZzdhlRmYWtN9JQ.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=2400 682w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/Y8zctiDQXuSnZzdhlRmYWtN9JQ.jpg?scale-down-to=2048&width=1600&height=2400 1365w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/Y8zctiDQXuSnZzdhlRmYWtN9JQ.jpg?width=1600&height=2400 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":2400}\u0000\u0000\u0000\tmq0eWtBEC\u0005\u0000\u0000\u0000\ty72IubAIV\u0000\u0000\u0000\tNWx5CmGIH\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\fQuarto Books\u0000\u0000\u0000\tIKpV3idiu\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u00042022\u0000\u0000\u0000\tuHIiVM0f7\f\u0000\u0000\u00007Twelve backlist titles reissued on a single spine grid.\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTQlyc4LYg\f\u0000\u0000\u0001\u001cQuarto's backlist had been designed one book at a time across thirty years, so a shelf of their own titles looked like twelve different publishers. We held the spine grid fixed and let only the image change, which made the series read as a series without reprinting a single interior.\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMLdub4Cf1\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0007Premise\u0000\u0000\u0000\tJlDz2I3mw\u0001\u0000\u0002\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMovVmTu_T\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/Y8zctiDQXuSnZzdhlRmYWtN9JQ.jpg?width=1600&height=2400\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/Y8zctiDQXuSnZzdhlRmYWtN9JQ.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=2400 682w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/Y8zctiDQXuSnZzdhlRmYWtN9JQ.jpg?scale-down-to=2048&width=1600&height=2400 1365w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/Y8zctiDQXuSnZzdhlRmYWtN9JQ.jpg?width=1600&height=2400 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":2400}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tAbblhm_MH\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMovVmTu_T\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/xZD8F2tAcfRvt2nSdGeZCBItWM.jpg?width=1600&height=2405\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/xZD8F2tAcfRvt2nSdGeZCBItWM.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=2405 681w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/xZD8F2tAcfRvt2nSdGeZCBItWM.jpg?scale-down-to=2048&width=1600&height=2405 1362w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/xZD8F2tAcfRvt2nSdGeZCBItWM.jpg?width=1600&height=2405 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":2405}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tOtAkfQ2ld\u0000\u0000\u0000\triLYNSE32\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0003�[1,[4,\"h3\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Eleven millimetres\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The books were not the problem. The spines were.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Reprinting interiors was out of the question, so everything had to be solved in the eleven millimetres a reader sees on a shelf.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Quarto’s backlist had been acquired in pieces over twenty years. Twelve titles that belong together intellectually had been set by five different houses, and on a shelf they read as five different publishers.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Resetting the interiors would have cost more than the reissue could earn back. That left the covers and spines as the entire available surface — and the spine is where a backlist is actually encountered.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Eleven millimetres is enough for a title, an author and a number, provided you decide in advance that it is enough.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tXLMO7aY2_\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\nMy Process\u0000\u0000\u0000\tC_x3Rv7F7\u0001\u0000\u0004\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000eBacklist Audit\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Pulled all twelve titles and shelved them together. The inconsistency was worse than anyone had described.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/yPDPgJb7KLLyjKXciOtqPtfYf0.jpg?width=1600&height=1068\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/yPDPgJb7KLLyjKXciOtqPtfYf0.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1068 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/yPDPgJb7KLLyjKXciOtqPtfYf0.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1068 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/yPDPgJb7KLLyjKXciOtqPtfYf0.jpg?width=1600&height=1068 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1068}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tKLkpffqEK\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\nSpine Grid\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Fixed the title, author and imprint positions, then checked the grid against the thinnest and thickest book in the set.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/N1y3mfxLH7e5llLA5vhKIYC49s.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/N1y3mfxLH7e5llLA5vhKIYC49s.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/N1y3mfxLH7e5llLA5vhKIYC49s.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/N1y3mfxLH7e5llLA5vhKIYC49s.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tcbyEBJpcr\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\rCover Studies\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000�[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Ran the image as the only variable across all twelve, so the range holds together even face-out.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/DXVqoeiof5I9BnvwK0WZ9KyjP8.jpg?width=1600&height=1274\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/DXVqoeiof5I9BnvwK0WZ9KyjP8.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1274 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/DXVqoeiof5I9BnvwK0WZ9KyjP8.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1274 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/DXVqoeiof5I9BnvwK0WZ9KyjP8.jpg?width=1600&height=1274 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1274}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tVumfH9GY3\t\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\txnVVYHFui\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000bPress Check\u0000\u0000\u0000\tyUPsshLXe\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000i[1,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Attended the first run to match the spine black across two paper stocks.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tHAT4_1Uxk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/zbx1uDjIngYlt4ZNkKbP9DZLrKw.jpg?width=1600&height=1068\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/zbx1uDjIngYlt4ZNkKbP9DZLrKw.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1068 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/zbx1uDjIngYlt4ZNkKbP9DZLrKw.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1068 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/zbx1uDjIngYlt4ZNkKbP9DZLrKw.jpg?width=1600&height=1068 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1068}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tzAgZ5BlhM\u0000\u0000\u0000\tEyR2Wzw92\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0007Outcome\u0000\u0000\u0000\tZP1WHsR_A\u0001\u0000\u0003\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/apVMCnBQjmJ0iRdz9bykfUJRPg.jpg?width=1600&height=1071\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/apVMCnBQjmJ0iRdz9bykfUJRPg.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1071 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/apVMCnBQjmJ0iRdz9bykfUJRPg.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1071 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/apVMCnBQjmJ0iRdz9bykfUJRPg.jpg?width=1600&height=1071 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1071}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\temaXon2re\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/PfHK2a2En8bAJ8vpI7gzpm7Ivec.jpg?width=1600&height=1068\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/PfHK2a2En8bAJ8vpI7gzpm7Ivec.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1068 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/PfHK2a2En8bAJ8vpI7gzpm7Ivec.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1068 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/PfHK2a2En8bAJ8vpI7gzpm7Ivec.jpg?width=1600&height=1068 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1068}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tMeufizVda\t\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\tpAzhg6bsk\n\u0000\u0000\u0001�{\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/zhfMhcgHWQGC1sP8N9vRn1RyB7A.jpg?width=1600&height=1067\",\"srcSet\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/zhfMhcgHWQGC1sP8N9vRn1RyB7A.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1600&height=1067 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/zhfMhcgHWQGC1sP8N9vRn1RyB7A.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1600&height=1067 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/zhfMhcgHWQGC1sP8N9vRn1RyB7A.jpg?width=1600&height=1067 1600w\",\"pixelWidth\":1600,\"pixelHeight\":1067}\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0002id\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\td1BaBFy1C\u0000\u0000\u0000\tsyIho584u\u000b\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0004\"[1,[4,\"h3\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Twelve covers, one grid\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Twelve covers, one spine grid, interiors untouched.\"]],[4,\"ul\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Backlist reissued without resetting a page\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Spine grid extended to four later titles\"]]],[4,\"li\",{\"data-preset-tag\":\"p\"},[4,\"p\",null,[5,\"Series shelved together for the first time\"]]]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The grid fixes four positions down the spine and nothing else. Title, author, series number and imprint sit at the same heights on every book, so a shelf reads as a run even where the trim sizes differ by a few millimetres.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Cover artwork was deliberately left free. The series coheres from the edge, which means a strong individual cover costs the set nothing.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Four titles published since have been set to the same grid by Quarto’s in-house team. The series has been shelved together in shops for the first time since 2004.\"]]]\u0000\u0000\u0000\tCZlJgboHp\u0001\u0000\u0003\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tQUWcA5vdt\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tGBYeeO0g_\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\tTDKghDQMs"
